# ── npm bundled internals (usr/local/lib/node_modules/npm/) ──────────────────
# These CVEs are in packages bundled inside npm's own CLI installation.
# They are not in the application's dependency tree and are not exploitable
# in the app's runtime context. npm itself is a build/package-management tool
# that is present in the base node:20-alpine image; it cannot be upgraded
# independently without rebuilding the base image.

