# ── esbuild Go stdlib (app/node_modules/esbuild/bin/esbuild) ──────────────────
# esbuild is a build tool (devDependency) whose binary should be removed from
# the production image by the Dockerfile's `rm -rf node_modules/esbuild/bin`
# step. These entries are kept as a belt-and-suspenders backstop in case a
# cached layer is scanned before the fix propagates.
# The Go stdlib CVEs below affect HTTP/TLS handling inside esbuild's built-in
# dev server, which is never started in production.

